**Analysis:**\n\
- **Aether Vial** - Excellent turn 1 play, the backbone of Goblin strategies\n\
- **Bloodstained Mire** - Fetchland, great mana fixing\n\
- **Wasteland** - Utility land, can produce colorless for Vial\n\
